<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Link Not Found | 404</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center h-screen">
    <div class="text-center px-4">
        <h1 class="text-9xl font-bold text-indigo-600">404</h1>
        <p class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-4">Oops! This link has expired or never existed.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">The short URL you followed is incorrect or has been deleted by the owner.</p>
        <a href="/" class="mt-6 inline-block bg-indigo-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-indigo-700 transition">
            Create Your Own Link
        </a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>